## License category

This is a proprietary, source-inspectable, use-only Application license. It permits an Authorized Copy to be inspected,
installed, technically transformed as necessary for unchanged Neutron execution, run, backed up, restored, migrated,
and removed only in a Qualifying Sovereign System. It does not grant permission to modify, adapt, create derivative
works, sublicense, Convey, or Operate the Application Work for another. All rights not expressly granted are reserved.

The Qualifying Sovereign System condition applies to every person, including a Sovereign User; there is no private-user
Production Use exception. A good-faith user may recover, export, migrate, or remove software and User Data when
qualification fails, but may not continue ordinary nonqualifying Production Use. These restrictions are intentional.
This License is not an OSI-approved Open Source or Free Software license and must not be described as one.

## Preamble

This License lets an Application's source be inspected while its owner retains control of modification and distribution.
It grants only the rights needed for a lawful recipient to use the unchanged Application in a personal software system
where the user can choose packages, compile a private personal system, replace the Kernel, and receive fair treatment for
Applications.

It permits assembly with an independently licensed Kernel. When an NPL governs the Kernel, this License coordinates with
that NPL's Application Assembly Exception. Compiling an Application into the same canister executable as a Kernel does
not change either component's license.

The License Category and Preamble explain classification and purpose. The numbered sections state the operative terms.

